WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.200
tu relación

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.720
is so interesting.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.880
But imagine the passion

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.040
in the bedroom.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.840
So will you come to

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.240
Christmas Eve dinner, darling?

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.560
Jerk.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.320
If you can't handle

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.080
one woman,

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:27.840
how do you expect

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.960
to run a company?

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.120
You're doubting me, dad?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.160
You're giving me plenty

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.360
of reasons to.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.440
You have one week

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.720
to get her in line.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.240
I expect both of you

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.280
at Christmas dinner.
